---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: <span data-i18n="static.resources.machineryTitle">Farm Machinery</span> & Equipment | GoOrganicAfrica
description: Farm machinery and equipment resources for African farmers and agribusinesses.
permalink: "/farm-machinery/"
---
{% include "partials/language-selectors/static.njk" %}

<section class="section" style="padding-top:48px;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:900px;">
    <span class="eyebrow"><span data-i18n="static.resources.eyebrow">Farmer Resources</span></span>
    <h1><span data-i18n="static.resources.machineryTitle">Farm Machinery</span></h1>
    <p class="lede"><span data-i18n="static.resources.machineryIntro">Tractors, planters, harvesters, irrigation, processing, greenhouse and other farm equipment.</span></p>
    <p><span data-i18n="static.resources.machineryText">The directory includes verified machinery and mechanization resources, with direct official links and verification dates. Some entries are information or financing resources rather than machinery sellers; the description makes that distinction clear.</span></p>
    <div style="display:grid;gap:18px;margin-top:30px;">
{% for item in directoryListings.listings %}{% if item.type == "machinery" and item.active != false %}
      <article class="ebook-card" style="padding:22px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">{{ item.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ item.description }}</p>
        <p><strong>{{ item.country }}</strong>{% if item.category %} · {{ item.category }}{% endif %}</p>
        {% if item.official_source %}<p><strong data-i18n="static.resources.directoryLabels.officialSource">Official source:</strong> {{ item.official_source }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if item.verification_date %}<p><strong data-i18n="static.resources.directoryLabels.verified">Verified:</strong> {{ item.verification_date }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if item.notes %}<p><small>{{ item.notes }}</small></p>{% endif %}
        {% if item.url %}<p><a href="{{ item.url }}"><span data-i18n="static.resources.directoryLabels.open">Open official resource</span></a></p>{% endif %}
      </article>
{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
